  "body": "### What is the issue with the Storage Standard?\n\nI have completed the translation of the storage specification into Simplified Chinese (简体中文). Here is the link to the translated document:\r\n\r\n- [Translated version of the specification in Simplified Chinese](https://htmlspecs.com/storage)\r\n\r\nIt would be helpful for international users if this link could be added to the official documentation or the README.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering this request!",
